@{
}

<section class="bd-hero">
    <div class="container text-center">
        <span class="bd-eyebrow"><i class="bi bi-signpost-2"></i> How it works</span>
        <h1 class="mt-3 mb-3">Pack once. Move once. Hand it all back.</h1>
        <p class="lead mx-auto">
            From booking to pickup, here is exactly what happens and what we need from you.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="bd-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row g-5">
            <div class="col-lg-7">
                <div class="d-flex gap-4 mb-5">
                    <div><div class="bd-step-number">1</div></div>
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="h5 fw-bold">Book online</h2>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-2">
                            Choose the bundle that matches your home, pick your delivery and pickup dates, and
                            enter the address we're delivering to. We'll confirm your ZIP is in our service
                            area before you pay, and show any zone surcharge up front.
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
                            You'll be asked to keep a card on file. That card is only charged again if you
                            extend the rental or if crates come back damaged or missing.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="d-flex gap-4 mb-5">
                    <div><div class="bd-step-number">2</div></div>
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="h5 fw-bold">We deliver</h2>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-2">
                            Your crates, dollies, and reusable labels arrive inside a two hour window. Our driver
                            stacks them wherever you want them, usually the garage or living room. There is
                            nothing to sign for and nothing to assemble.
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
                            Windows are 8am&ndash;10am, 10am&ndash;12pm, 12pm&ndash;2pm, or 2pm&ndash;4pm.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="d-flex gap-4 mb-5">
                    <div><div class="bd-step-number">3</div></div>
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="h5 fw-bold">You pack, move, and unpack</h2>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-2">
                            Seven full days is the standard rental, which is enough for most moves without
                            rushing. Label the crates with the reusable tags, stack them, and load them.
                            They interlock, so a truck packs tighter than it would with cardboard.
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
                            Need longer? Extend by the week from your dashboard at any time, even after
                            delivery. We charge the card on file and move your pickup date automatically.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="d-flex gap-4">
                    <div><div class="bd-step-number">4</div></div>
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="h5 fw-bold">We pick up</h2>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-2">
                            On your pickup day, leave the empty crates and dollies stacked by the front door or
                            in the garage. You don't need to be home. We count them, load them, and you're done.
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
                            Give them a quick wipe if anything spilled. Crates needing a deep clean carry a
                            small per-crate fee, listed in the
                            <a asp-controller="Legal" asp-action="RentalTerms">rental terms</a>.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-5">
                <div class="bd-card mb-4">
                    <div class="bd-card-body">
                        <h3 class="h6 fw-bold mb-3">What's in every bundle</h3>
                        <ul class="bd-feature-list mb-0">
                            <li>Stackable crates with attached lids</li>
                            <li>Rolling dollies rated for full stacks</li>
                            <li>Reusable room labels</li>
                            <li>Delivery and pickup on your dates</li>
                            <li>Seven day rental as standard</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="bd-divider-note">
                    <p class="fw-semibold mb-1"><i class="bi bi-lightbulb me-1"></i>Sizing tip</p>
                    <p class="small text-muted mb-0">
                        People underestimate more often than they overestimate. If you're between two
                        bundles, take the larger one &mdash; adding crates mid-rental costs more per crate
                        than starting with the bigger bundle.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="d-grid gap-2 mt-4">
                    <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" asp-controller="Booking" asp-action="Index">Book your crates</a>
                    <a class="btn btn-outline-primary" asp-action="Faq">Read the FAQ</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
